---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title={`聯絡我們 | 10Best Living`} description={`與10Best Living團隊聯繫。我們歡迎問題、反饋和合作洽詢。`} path={`/contact`}>
  <div class="bg-card">
    <div class="py-20 lg:py-28 bg-gradient-to-br from-cream via-cream-dark to-cream">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8 text-center" data-aos="fade-up">
        <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-primary mb-6 leading-tight">聯絡我們</h1>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8 py-16">
      <div data-lang-content="zh-TW">
        <div class="prose-content text-lg leading-relaxed text-primary" data-aos="fade-up">
<h2 id="sec-1">與我們聯絡</h2>
<p>我們期待收到您的消息。無論您對評論有疑問、產品建議或合作洽詢，我們的團隊隨時為您服務。</p>

<h2 id="sec-2">電子郵件</h2>
<p>通用問題及評論請求：<a href="mailto:hello@10bestliving.com" class="text-gold">hello@10bestliving.com</a></p>
<p>廣告及合作洽詢：<a href="mailto:partnerships@10bestliving.com" class="text-gold">partnerships@10bestliving.com</a></p>

<h2 id="sec-3">回覆時間</h2>
<p>我們力圖在2個工作日內回覆所有查詢。繁忙時期可能需要最多48小時。</p>

<h2 id="sec-4">關注我們</h2>
<p>在社交媒體上關注10Best Living，獲取最新評論、優惠和產品推薦：</p>
<ul>
<li>Facebook: @10BestLiving</li>
<li>Instagram: @10bestliving</li>
<li>Twitter: @10BestLiving</li>
<li>Pinterest: @10BestLiving</li>
</ul>

<h2 id="sec-5">辦公室</h2>
<p>10Best Living<br>基於美國的遠程優先團隊<br>成立於2026年</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div data-lang-content="en" style="display:none">
        <div class="prose-content text-lg leading-relaxed text-primary" data-aos="fade-up">
<h2 id="sec-1">Get in Touch</h2>
<p>We look forward to hearing from you. Whether you have questions about our reviews, product suggestions, or partnership inquiries, our team is here to help.</p>

<h2 id="sec-2">Email</h2>
<p>General inquiries and review requests: <a href="mailto:hello@10bestliving.com" class="text-gold">hello@10bestliving.com</a></p>
<p>Advertising and partnerships: <a href="mailto:partnerships@10bestliving.com" class="text-gold">partnerships@10bestliving.com</a></p>

<h2 id="sec-3">Response Time</h2>
<p>We strive to respond to all inquiries within 2 business days. During busy periods, responses may take up to 48 hours.</p>

<h2 id="sec-4">Follow Us</h2>
<p>Follow 10Best Living on social media for the latest reviews, deals, and product recommendations:</p>
<ul>
<li>Facebook: @10BestLiving</li>
<li>Instagram: @10bestliving</li>
<li>Twitter: @10BestLiving</li>
<li>Pinterest: @10BestLiving</li>
</ul>

<h2 id="sec-5">Office</h2>
<p>10Best Living<br>A remote-first team based in the United States<br>Established in 2026</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>


